      "message": "Better to inspect the active event I think, so we continue only if we\u0027ve received `AP_PWRSEQ_EVENT_POWER_STARTUP`.\n\nPossibly also want to stop the timer if we continue, just to ensure it won\u0027t trigger spurious events later.",
